# CODEOWNERS — team-based review routing
#
# Worker-agnostic by design: code is owned by TEAMS and ROLES, never by a named
# individual. A team may hold human or machine (agent/bot) workers, so review
# coverage survives any single worker joining, leaving or being unavailable.
# Last match wins.
#
# Enforcement: the repository "main" ruleset requires 1 approving review and a
# code-owner review. Organization administrators retain a permanent bypass, so
# the owner is never blocked (see the ruleset bypass_actors).

# Default owner: any reviewer-team member can satisfy the code-owner review.
*                                   @Conxian/reviewers

# Governance, policy and this file itself — org administration.
/CODEOWNERS                         @Conxian/conxian-admin
/GOVERNANCE.md                      @Conxian/conxian-admin
/CONTRIBUTING.md                    @Conxian/conxian-admin
/SECURITY.md                        @Conxian/conxian-admin
/.github/                           @Conxian/conxian-admin

